Subject: [PATCH 4.9 033/151] clk: mmp2: fix the clock id for sdh2_clk and sdh3_clk
Date:   Wed, 27 Nov 2019 21:30:16 +0100
Message-Id: <20191127203020.869830028@linuxfoundation.org>
